 "gutenberg": "Project Gutenberg eBook #72126 — https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/72126",
 "copyright": "Public domain worldwide: the text was published long ago and every named author/translator died in or before 1955.",
 "markdown_file": "Americas/Caribbean (Suriname and the Dutch Antilles)/063 - Spin voert den Dood in.md",
 "stats": {
  "paragraphs": 33,
